WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:13.950
What's this?

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.410
It's from when we...

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:24.740
Here.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.290
She's so popular.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.580
Demon King!

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.740
The hero is nearing the land for the new area.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:36.450
What?! It's still under construction!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.700
Indeed, and the traps and treasure
chests haven't been installed yet.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.080
This isn't good. I'll go check it out.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.120
Yes, sir.

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.620
La la la!

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.450
Um, Princess? Do you have a moment?

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.080
Get in line.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.240
Huh? Oh, okay.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.700
A pajama party?

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:03.330
Yes, it's next week.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.790
How about it? I hope you'll join!

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.700
Royalty

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.700
Highly sought after for parties

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:14.200
Um, you'll get a uniquely pleasant
and cheerful sleep.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.580
Is that true?

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.580
Y-Yes!

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:23.580
I see... A party that'll give me a uniquely
pleasant and cheerful sleep?

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.290
I must attend!

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:30.990
"Quest"
"Attend Party and Sleep Cheerfully"

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:06.040
"Eleventh Night"
"The Princess and Troubling Dreams"

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.620
Hero!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:13.740
Demon King!

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:17.870
Beyond this is a dead end.
Continue down the left path!

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:18.870
What?

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:21.830
You hear? Go left, not straight!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.580
That's right, quickly follow the left path!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.830
Left! Left! Go left!

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.490
Curses! Okay, to the left!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.040
He's just going to listen to him?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:46.740
I worked hard today.
Now for some well-earned rest to--

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.740
Princess?!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.490
Hey, what are you--

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:59.040
I've come to hold a practice
pajama party with you.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.580
A practice pajama party?!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:05.910
Reason one: I was invited to a party
where I'll get good rest.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:11.580
Reason two: As I was formally invited,
I'll need to have a partner to escort me.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:16.330
Reason three: It is only appropriate that
one who possesses authority be my partner.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.740
Lord of castle

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.490
So I've come to you.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.450
I don't think that's necessary!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.790
A-And aren't pajama parties usually--

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:26.660
Huh?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.490
H-Hang on. What do you know
about pajama parties?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:38.880
Called
'pajama
party'

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:38.880
Dress
code:
pajamas

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.880
That's it

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.240
So you basically know nothing!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:42.540
Then what do you think people do at them?

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.580
I'm rather sleepy.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.040
Indeed, I am.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.580
I'm quite drowsy.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.950
Your nobility is showing! In a bad way!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.160
Royalty

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.410
Then you tell me.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:05:04.330
I-I'm no expert, but I-I once read
that they talk of love and such...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.540
Sorry, my fault.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:20.910
But don't you have any such experiences?
D-Do you have a crush--

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.660
Oh, what about the fiancé you mentioned?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:28.700
Bomb

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.700
Sorry. Forget I said it.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:33.790
D-Whatsit was like the sun, in a negative sense.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.160
In a negative sense?!

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:44.450
Looking it up, there's nothing I don't
already know under "pajama parties."

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.200
Takes
place
in a
home

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.200
Pajamas, nightwear

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.200
Talk
about
love

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:48.700
Right...

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.580
Demon King's way of 
getting on her good side

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.580
Take a little more interest, will you?!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.080
But I have nothing to say about love.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:59.990
Will you leave, then?
I need my sleep, too, you know.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.330
Oh, right. What about you?

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:03.120
Huh?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.240
Let's hear your love stories.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:11.240
Uh... Well... I... long ago--No, not that!

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:15.240
Er, um... Princess! You... uh... you know...

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:20.020
Clumsily changes the subject

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:20.660
You've been living here a while now.
There must be someone...

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.660
Oh?

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:24.200
I need to give him these documents by tonight.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:27.830
Demon King--

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:34.290
Then you think it's acceptable
for humans and demons to fall in love?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.290
Huh?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:41.990
You think it's acceptable for humans
and demons to fall in love?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.580
...humans and demons to fall in love?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:46.740
In love? The demon king and the princess?

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.740
...fall in love?

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:51.080
In cannot be! I must stop this at once.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.540
Forbidden. Forbidden.
Forbidden. Forbidden.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.410
Forbidden. Forbidden.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.120
Forbidden!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.830
Then, that would...

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.080
Hey, Princess?!

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:09.290
No, wait! You misunderstand!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.540
I don't want to hear your excuses!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.290
...your excuses! ...your excuses!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.830
Wait, calm down!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.830
Did someone else join us?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:22.410
You'll break it! You'll break it! You'll break it!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:22.410
Yes, I thought something was missing.

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.700
Wait!

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:24.700
Parties need to be lively.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:34.200
I see, it's a time to have fun,
talk about your love experiences,

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.290
and snack in your pajamas.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:43.240
Pajama parties are a banquet for wondrous sleep.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:49.240
Well? What did you do to the princess?

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.120
Hear me out! It's all a misunderstanding!

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.830
Uh... Yes! It was practice!
We were just practicing.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.540
We didn't... We didn't really do it!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.540
What?!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.660
No, that's not right!
That's not what I meant! I--

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:05.540
Brace yourself!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.790
Brace yourself!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:11.740
Stop! Brace yourself! No!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:11.740
So noisy. I can't sleep here.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:12.740
Brace--

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:16.370
What?! You're not coming?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.870
Nope, no need after my practice run.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:19.870
What?!

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:24.020
"Quest Cancelled"

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.120
Abandoned quest.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.120
Um, P-Princess?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.330
Aw...

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:34.030
Demon King

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.490
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:40.040
The succubus is a demon
who feeds off human vitality.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:45.580
Therefore, it is a necessity of life
for them to be popular.

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:51.330
And here is a succubus
who is starving for popularity.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:55.160
I'll have bird beast egg custard for dinner.
It's been a while!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.290
You just had it the day before yesterday!

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:06.410
I feel like bird beast egg custard today!
Maybe someone will invite me to have some?

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:07.830
Gotta have the egg custard!

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:20.740
I feel like playing hide-and-seek.
Anyone want to play with me?

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.580
Argh! I'm so not popular!

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.790
The human princess is always so popular...

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.300
Through Cubey's eyes

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.830
I wish I could be like the princess.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.120
Princess! I'll have my revenge today!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:40.990
Huh?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.410
Oh, wait. It's just you, Cubey.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.660
You two look so similar, I mistook you for her.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.370
The princess and I... look similar?

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:57.040
Why am I still so sleepy? I slept so much.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.200
Am I not sleeping well?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.450
Why didn't I realize sooner?
For a failure like me to look...

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.950
...so much like the princess!

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:14.200
Wow! We really do look alike!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:20.870
So if I learn how to boost my appeal
from her, I can be popular like her!

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:25.240
I even asked to trade meal duty today.
Now's my chance!

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:30.330
Princess! I came here to become like you!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.370
Become like me?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.740
I see. She's here to become my body double?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:38.990
Misunderstanding

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.030
Sure.

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.120
Really?

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.200
She accepted so quickly!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:50.910
Has there been a warning
to train up my body doubles?

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:54.740
It must mean that there are rogues
out there to attack me.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:59.660
I cannot sleep in peace until I have
trained a perfect body double!

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.910
"Quest"
"Sleep After Training A Body Double"

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:10.160
I'll train you to be an elite body double.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.870
Yes, I'll be an elite student in popularity!

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.160
The start of misunderstandings.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:22.910
I'm Cubey.
That's what my succubus friends call me.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:26.620
Oh? Well, say goodbye to that name.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.830
Huh? But why?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.790
Huh?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.870
Do I need to change my name
to become more popular?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.090
Dumb

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.410
Argh!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:41.080
Oh-Oh, whatever. What do I need to do first?

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.330
First, do as I just did.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.370
What?!

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:52.410
Wait, why? Is that necessary?!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:56.240
It is. You must first raise your attack power.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.830
Attack power? But why?!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.830
Huh?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:04.580
Oh, maybe I'll be more popular if I'm stronger--

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.870
After you've done that,
we'll practice escaping prison.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.410
What was that explosion just now?!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:18.660
Wait. Is... Is she actually a crazy weirdo?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:23.490
Where are you going?
You must next learn my behavior patterns.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.830
Why am I tied up?!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.790
Hey, Princess! Where are we going?!

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:30.370
We must first gather materials.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.040
Ghost Shroud!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.620
Material number two.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.910
Ouch!

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.910
Sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:43.080
Now brush Teddy Demon.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.490
Oh, now that I can do.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.740
Actually, give it back.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.790
What?!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:53.210
A few hours later

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.540
Good work.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:01.540
Oh, no. We might look alike,
but I picked the wrong person.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.790
I'm exhausted!

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:07.040
Princess, do you always do this?

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.450
Huh? No, I sleep 80% of the time.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.450
What was the whole point of all this?!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.330
Argh! Then all the pain was for nothing!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:18.450
Why didn't you just tell me
to sleep from the start?!

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:19.990
You don't get it.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:23.870
All of our actions until now were for
the sake of a having wonderful sleep.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:27.490
And with that sleep, you become a wonderful me.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.450
Aren't you here to become me?

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.450
Yes, sorry.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.410
I'll admit, you've done a good job keeping up.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:41.290
Lastly, I'll teach you the crucial point
that will make you an elite.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.740
Really? Wh-What's that?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:47.450
Will she finally tell me
the secret to her popularity?

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.620
And that is...

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:55.120
And that is to not fear death.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:55.950
Huh?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.790
The ability to easily die
when needed is a mark of the elite.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:00.790
Wh--?

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.790
Go on, try it out.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.580
Come on. Give it a try.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:09.240
No, no! Wait! I really don't think
I need to try this one!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.120
Stop pushing! This can't have anything
to do with becoming popular!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:17.490
Worry not. I'll send word to
the old man who'll revive you.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:20.870
Old m--?! That's not the point!

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.580
Crap. Oh, no, this is no joke.

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:24.990
This princess is dead serious!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:30.040
I'm sorry! I really can't do this!

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.200
Oh... This will kill me.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:45.990
But I have nothing else to teach.
I've raised a competent body double.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.990
I can now rest in peace.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:53.790
Princess' grave

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:01.790
Zzz...

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:09.930
Quest Complete

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.950
Found rest, in more ways than one.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.160
Princess! How many times have
I told you to value your life?

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.120
Wait.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.080
Huh?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:19.080
I now have a body double. Chastise her instead.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.160
Nope!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.740
Later, Cubey, the succubus...

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:31.370
You're great. I like you.
You're a fine body double.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.540
No!

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.540
...was popular with the princess.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.160
I'm jealous.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:42.960
Cubey

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.910
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:47.910
Next, we'll discuss how the new
area's construction is progressing--

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:55.660
Huh?

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:59.950
These past few days, I don't feel rested
no matter how much sleep I get.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:04.990
I feel fatigued despite getting
plenty of sleep. All of you...

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:09.240
...should help me think of
the reason behind this.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.660
We're in an important meeting here!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.700
Nonsense! Figure this out by yourself--

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.870
She's already asleep!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.330
Looks like she's having a nightmare.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.700
That doesn't look normal.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:34.910
A-ha, so that's why you brought me.

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:39.950
Yes, I'm afraid she'll try something else
because of this. Find the cause.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:48.040
Hm... Mostly likely, someone has entered her
dreams and is causing trouble inside.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.120
Who?

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.200
We can find out who...

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:57.120
...by peeking into her dreams.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.740
Wow!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:59.910
There's the princess!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.830
What an odd place.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.580
A grassy plain?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.700
She's in a blanket even in her dream.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.290
Sheesh, it's probably just the Teddy Demons.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.910
Princess! Princess!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.330
Princess!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:17.990
Huh?

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.790
What?! The hero?!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:21.830
Why?

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:25.330
And why would the hero cause a nightmare?

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:27.790
Figured it out

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.660
Wow, to see you in my dreams!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.080
Well, I guess you forget your
dreams when you wake up.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:34.240
What?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.950
"Scary childhood friend"
"D-Whatsit"
"Person she sees now"

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.660
"Same person!"

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>D-Whatsit has appeared!</i>

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.120
Oh, what is it, Princess?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>What will you do?</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>Fight</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.160
<i>Run</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.160
<i>Item</i>

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.160
<i>Save</i>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>Run</i>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>Item</i>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:46.920
<i>Save</i>

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:48.990
Princess!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:51.800
<i>Run</i>

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:55.370
Wait, what? Why did she dropkick him?

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:58.240
Does the princess hate the hero?

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:01.580
Well, she doesn't even
recognize him as the hero.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.830
Hypnos! What's going on? What's happening--

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:07.040
Zzz...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.330
Why the heck are you sleeping?!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.950
Sleeps 20 hours a day

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.410
Well, um... Actually--

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.700
Princess!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:16.410
It's a race! I won't lose!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:18.490
Resilient and optimistic!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.740
No, he simply doesn't care...

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:25.950
I found you!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.620
Hero!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.540
Hey, the hero fell!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:34.370
Wait, why is she acting like that?
He's the one coming to save her!

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.410
This must be a shock to him,
even if this is within a dream!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:42.950
Princess! This cliff is perfect for rock climbing!

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.080
Is there something wrong with this dude?

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.290
Join me!

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:49.040
Princess!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:54.080
Oh, sorry! I didn't expect you to be so light.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.990
I guess girls usually are! Wow!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.030
Panicking

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.200
There's gotta be something wrong with him!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.580
Oh, the hero is rather frightening!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:03.620
Scary...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.160
He's a model hero when journeying.
Is this the real him?

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.700
No, it's because--

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.990
Are we playing tag now?

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:18.160
But how was the hero able to enter
the princess' dreams in the first place?

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:20.290
The princess is the total victim here--

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:25.700
Or maybe she's not!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:28.370
Hypnos! The cause!

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:34.830
Ah, it's likely the Dream Travel Slip
fastened to the hero's hip.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:38.410
What? But I don't remember him
obtaining such an item...

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:43.240
Get someone's signature on
the back of the summoning circle,

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.870
and you can enter their dreams
when you sleep with it.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.120
A signature?

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.450
So the princess signed it herself?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.660
She drew that during our trip
to the Human Realm...

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:02.370
Sh-She did! She was handing out tons
of autographs to the Teddy Demons!

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.370
What?!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.120
But how did the hero get it?

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:09.870
Quickly follow the left path!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.620
Left! Left! Go left!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.410
The demon king has crumpled to the floor!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.910
He seems to know how!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.580
I see we're racing through an obstacle course!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:31.540
What a surprise. I never knew this
was the kind of relationship they had.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:36.120
But he seems strangely familiar...

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:38.330
Same here.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.040
You all, as well?

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.740
Wait for me!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.740
Yes... somewhat frightening...

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.740
Unusually resilient...

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:48.540
Unintentionally puts the princess in danger...

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.330
Name starts with "D"...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.700
D-Whatsit = Princess' fiancé

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.700
What?!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:59.080
What? Her fiancé?! He's her fiancé?!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:59.080
It's him?

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.450
I will go retrieve that paper at once!

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:02.450
Already knew

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:02.490
Already knew

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:02.530
Already knew

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:02.570
Already knew

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.330
I have successfully retrieved it!
What of the princess?

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:09.080
Demon King... how should I put it?

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.290
Zzz...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.660
Shows how terrible it was for her.

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:21.870
Serve her some cake tomorrow.

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:22.870
As you wish.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:30.200
Don't you think the hero can handle a more
brutal game balance with his resilience?

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.370
Agreed!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:36.740
It's unanimous! Modify the new area
under construction to super hard mode!

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:38.040
Yeah!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:46.160
Thus, the princess unknowingly delayed
her rescue from the Demon Castle yet again.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:55.540
I think I had a nightmare, but that
was the best sleep I've had in days...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.200
Cake!

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:09.410
Oh, it's snowing.

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:47.580
To sleep on both ears means to sleep
soundly without a care in the world.

00:23:47.580 --> 00:23:51.200
I could sleep even better if I had <i>that</i> , though.

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:53.870
Next is the final night,
<i>Sleeping Princess of the Demon Castle</i> .

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.540
You must watch.
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
